  "ruleText": "Tax 101.02 Absence of a Rule. These rules are not a limitation on the board's statutory duties or powers. The absence of a rule does not limit the board's power to act pursuant to its statutory authorization.\n\nSource. #2943, eff 12-31-84; EXPIRED 12-31-90\n\nNew. #5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #7068, INTERIM, eff 8-15-99, EXPIRES, 12-13-99; ss by #7152, eff 12-10-99; ss by #8985, eff 9-24-07; ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14; ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
